OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine September day for much
OL,6,Fof the UK, with sunny spells and light
OL,7,Fwinds. A few light showers are
OL,8,Fpossible, these mainly in the west.
OL,9,FCloud increasing across the northwest
OL,10,Flater on this afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain and brisk winds pushing
OL,13,Fsoutheastwards across Northern Ireland
OL,14,Fand Scotland, reaching parts of
OL,15,Fnorthern England towards dawn. Dry
OL,16,Felsewhere, with clear spells. Turning
OL,17,Fchilly in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
