OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FRain edging southeastwards,
OL,6,Fthough not reaching southern counties
OL,7,Fof England until late evening. Warm
OL,8,Fspells of sunshine ahead of this.
OL,9,FBreezy in the north with scattered
OL,10,Fshowers following the rain.
